<title>USA: Bancorp Connecticut Inc Q1 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Bancorp Connecticut Inc Q1 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTHINGTON, Conn. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.52		    $0.45</p>
<p> Net			  1,415		    1,284</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Total assets at March 31, 1997 were $147.11 million, versus $137.40 at March 31, 1996.</p>
<p>Provision for loan losses in Q1 1997 was $150,000 versus $75,000 in Q1 1996.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
